<view class="page tool-page">
  <view class="page-header">
    <view class="back-icon" bindtap="goBack">‹</view>
    <text>数据备份</text>
  </view>

  <view class="summary-card panel">
    <view class="summary-title">当前数据</view>
    <view class="summary-grid">
      <view>
        <text class="summary-number">{{summary.houseCount}}</text>
        <text class="summary-label">仓库</text>
      </view>
      <view>
        <text class="summary-number">{{summary.itemCount}}</text>
        <text class="summary-label">物品</text>
      </view>
      <view>
        <text class="summary-number">{{summary.billCount}}</text>
        <text class="summary-label">账单</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="summary-line">当前仓库：{{summary.currentHouseName}}</view>
    <view class="summary-line">生成时间：{{createdAtText}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="action-list">
    <button class="primary-action green-button" bindtap="exportLocal">导出本地备份</button>
    <button class="primary-action cloud-button" loading="{{cloudLoading}}" bindtap="backupToCloud">备份到云端</button>
  </view>

  <view class="notice panel">
    <view class="notice-title">备份说明</view>
    <text>本地备份会生成 JSON 文件，并同步复制备份文本到剪贴板。</text>
    <text>云端备份为手动快照，会保留最近 10 个版本。</text>
    <text>自定义本地图片跨设备可能无法恢复，内置图片不受影响。</text>
  </view>

  <onboarding-overlay
    visible="{{hintVisible}}"
    target="page-hint"
    title="备份前先确认数据范围"
    text="备份会导出当前程序中的仓库、物品和账单。建议在大量修改前先备份，恢复数据时再仔细确认是否覆盖当前仓库。"
    primary-text="知道了"
    show-secondary="{{false}}"
    bind:primary="closeHint"
  />
</view>
